The '''Alaafia Party''' ({{Langx|kz|ߊߟߊߊߝߌߊ ߘߊߊߕߌ|Àlàáfíà Páàtì}}) is a [[Pan-Kaftianism|Pan-Kaftian]] political party in [[Sanyan]]. 

Having governed Sanyan uninterrupted [[1960 Sanyan general election|since 1960]] (64 years), it has not seen its hegemony threatened and has always received over 70% of the votes and 90% of the seats in every subsequent general election. The Alaafia Party is the second-longest uninterrupted governing party among modern multiparty parliamentary democracies, and is the x-longest governing party in history after [[tba]].

